  "system": {
    "identifier": "bakuton-explosion-release-impact-landmine",
    "description": "<p>You channel explosive chakra into one of your striking limbs before striking the ground, causing an explosion, upturning the earth. All creature, excluding you in a 10-foot radius, centered on a point of your space, must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failure, they take 3d6 force damage and gain a rank of Dazzled or half as much damage on a success.  The affected area is difficult terrain until the end of your next turn to all creatures, excluding you.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage by 1d6. If this jutsu is cast at C-Rank or higher, creatures who fail their save are pushed back 10-feet.</p>",
